### B. `client/src/index.css`

Place all new rules together in one scoped hero/header section. Scope hero rules under `.workmate-marketing .workmate-hero` rather than changing global type tokens.

#### Hero shell and overflow root fix

```css
.workmate-hero__shell {
  width: min(100%, 1920px);
  min-width: 0;
  margin-inline: auto;
  padding: 92px 20px 40px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
  gap: 0;
}

.workmate-hero__shell > *,
.workmate-hero__content,
.workmate-hero__title,
.workmate-hero__description,
.workmate-hero__benefits,
.workmate-hero__actions,
.workmate-hero__visual {
  min-width: 0;
  max-width: 100%;
}

@media (max-width: 375px) {
  .workmate-hero__shell { padding: 88px 16px 36px; }
}

@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .workmate-hero__shell {
    padding: 112px 24px 64px;
    gap: 40px;
  }
}

@media (min-width: 1024px) {
  .workmate-hero__shell {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.05fr);
    padding: 128px clamp(32px, 2.5vw, 40px) 80px;
    gap: 56px;
  }
}

@media (min-width: 1280px) {
  .workmate-hero__shell { gap: 64px; }
}
```

